-ERROR:  cannot move system relation "pg_toast_1262_index"
 REINDEX (TABLESPACE regress_tblspace) INDEX CONCURRENTLY pg_toast.pg_toast_1262_index;
-ERROR:  cannot reindex system catalogs concurrently
